  "RawMarkdown": "# Alex Example\n**Target role: Database Platform Engineer**\n\n\n## Summary {#summary}\nDesigned PostgreSQL reporting queries and database backup recovery drills. Optimised PostgreSQL queries: measured test latency fell from 240 ms to 180 ms.\n\n## Experience {#experience}\n\n### Applied AI Engineer - Example Operations {#experience-261c4726577848d680395cfb0f81e20f}\n*Jan 2025 - Present*\n\n- Designed PostgreSQL reporting queries and database backup recovery drills.\n\n- Built a C# support-agent runtime using Azure OpenAI and Qdrant retrieval for internal operations.\n\n### Senior Software Engineer - Example Commerce {#experience-3e829653491947ceb739740041f07db2}\n*Jan 2018 - Dec 2024*\n\n- Optimised PostgreSQL queries: measured test latency fell from 240 ms to 180 ms.\n\n- Built C# billing retry queues and audit trails to enable the operations team to inspect failed attempts.\n\n- Led the API team and reviewed PostgreSQL recovery designs prior to production release.\n\n### Research Developer - Example Lab {#experience-d3d8b0dd88924145a19238b5af9e5a4b}\n*Jan 2015 - Dec 2017*\n\n- Built a Python/FastAPI document-classification prototype using PyTorch; it was never deployed to production.\n\n## Skills {#skills}\n**Role tools:** C#, PostgreSQL\n\n",
  "RawJson": null,
  "PlainText": "# Alex Example\n**Target role: Database Platform Engineer**\n\n\n## Summary {#summary}\nDesigned PostgreSQL reporting queries and database backup recovery drills. Optimised PostgreSQL queries: measured test latency fell from 240 ms to 180 ms.\n\n## Experience {#experience}\n\n### Applied AI Engineer - Example Operations {#experience-261c4726577848d680395cfb0f81e20f}\n*Jan 2025 - Present*\n\n- Designed PostgreSQL reporting queries and database backup recovery drills.\n\n- Built a C# support-agent runtime using Azure OpenAI and Qdrant retrieval for internal operations.\n\n### Senior Software Engineer - Example Commerce {#experience-3e829653491947ceb739740041f07db2}\n*Jan 2018 - Dec 2024*\n\n- Optimised PostgreSQL queries: measured test latency fell from 240 ms to 180 ms.\n\n- Built C# billing retry queues and audit trails to enable the operations team to inspect failed attempts.\n\n- Led the API team and reviewed PostgreSQL recovery designs prior to production release.\n\n### Research Developer - Example Lab {#experience-d3d8b0dd88924145a19238b5af9e5a4b}\n*Jan 2015 - Dec 2017*\n\n- Built a Python/FastAPI document-classification prototype using PyTorch; it was never deployed to production.\n\n## Skills {#skills}\n**Role tools:** C#, PostgreSQL\n\n",
